- **PC11, PC12, PC13, PC14** all successfully ping their gateway (192.168.200.1 = router4.eth0)
- **PC11 and PC13** successfully reach: 172.16.10.4 (PC4, Location A), 10.50.1.1, 192.168.100.1, 10.20.1.1, 192.168.1.1
